=== DOCUMENTED COMMAND SURFACE ===
84-The devkit validator checks package-root shape, application manifest v4 fields, generated UI files, the backend bundle manifest v1 seven-flag exposure authority, backend entry file presence, v4 SDK/backend-definition versions, and manifest path containment. It is a preflight tool for developers and CI; the server import/discovery validation remains the authoritative production gate.
